    "attributes": {
        "action": "Fund an anti-bullying 24-hour reporting service for students",
        "additional_details": "We believe all schools should have this service advertised on their school websites which allow students, as well as parents or carers to access it and report any bullying taking place outside of school. It should be accessible for everyone and available 24 hours a day to report bullying to a safeguarding lead.",
        "background": "Fund an anti-bullying system for students at schools which allows students to report bullying that takes place outside of school and is open 24-hours a day.",
